  ],
  "contract": [
    "Exact whole root/file/address/shape; literal UTF8 keys/strings and Double bit patterns, including signed zero.",
    "All retained typed integers and causal versions must round-trip exactly. Ineligible/raw/unknown/split roots retain existing typed decoding and refusal semantics.",
    "Model INSERT binds the actual written records.hash and checks one affected row; mismatch rolls back the entire command.",
    "Immutable publication material ends with the synchronous finish. No product cache, thread-local material, new store or executor.",
    "Original afterDigest and actual Undo result freeze retain their respective existing owners; no digest reuse.",
    "Public APIs, DB30/wire44/manifest26, authored histories, identities and keys unchanged."
  ],
